ADDITIONAL NOTICES (informational, not part of the MIT license terms)

  • AssuredAI is the reference implementation of the trust-centric AI
    framework described in "From AI Hype to Assured AI" (Fueled & WP Engine,
    2026). The framework's principles are independently authored; this
    repository ships the implementation.

  • Healthcare and government use: AssuredAI is HIPAA-aware and
    SOC 2-architected, but compliance posture depends on customer-specific
    deployment, BAA execution, and operational discipline. This software is
    provided as a reference implementation; production use in a regulated
    environment is the deployer's responsibility.

  • Source library content: AssuredAI ships with public-domain federal seed
    sources (CDC, NIH, FDA, HHS). Use of these sources is nominative fair use
    of public-domain content; AssuredAI claims no endorsement by these
    agencies.

  • PHI redaction is performed by Microsoft Presidio (Apache-2.0 licensed)
    running as a separate sidecar service; see deploy/presidio for details.
